d on weighted data and accounting for the complex survey design.\"}, {\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"A p-value of <0.05 was considered statistically significant.\"}, {\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"Data were weighted to represent the population of children aged 19–35 months\"}, {\"loc\": \"table 1\", \"q\": \"estimate not available if the unweighted sample size for the denominator was <30\"}, {\"loc\": \"table 2\", \"q\": \"Estimates are statistically significant at p<0.05.\"}], \"confidence\": \"high\", \"uncertain_fields\": [\"study_design\"]}", "type": "text"}]}